WEBVTT

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:03.280
Hi, there. I am just doing my video.

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:08.680
Um, I have the Even Realities
glasses on that I rented,

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.600
uh, through Whim, and I'm
just trying them out at home.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.460
I'm actually really pleased with them.

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:18.420
They are helping me a lot at work and

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:24.680
with friends, and I'm able to actually
understand words that I normally can't.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.960
So my problem isn't volume,
it's more speech clarity

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.140
and understanding words, certain words.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:37.370
So it's awesome to be able to look up
and find the word [clears throat] and

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:40.310
actually understand what
people are telling me,

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:42.980
as well as I really love
the AI cues as well.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.780
That gives me a lot more information
about what we're talking about.

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:49.560
All my friends are extremely
impressed as well.

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:54.380
So thank you. I'm really excited
to be using them even more.

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:57.060
And again, it's Even Realities

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:00.950
and, uh, I... It costs me
about 50 dollars a month.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.820
I just started renting them.

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:05.079
So thank you very much.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:08.760
Uh, I definitely recommend
them to everybody.

00:01:09.420 --> 00:01:12.780
Uh, it's definitely a life-changing tool.

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:14.370
God bless.
